                "title": "Elegant Egg-Shaped Knob With Rope Rose, Fusion 02-Z8",
                "description": "Fusion 02-Z8 , Traditional Egg-Shaped Knob With Rope Rose -- Although traditional in design, this classically styled knobset is not dated. The elegance it exudes means that it does not have to be surrounded by antiques to look like it belongs. This egg knob and rope rosette pair look expensive, adding its own aura to a room--one of true beauty. Every detail, from the egg-shaped knob to the rope detailing on the rose blend seamlessly. This solid brass knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Elegant Egg-Shaped Knob With Rope Rose is available in 5 finishes.",
